      "title_at_revision": "Fuel system hot weather operation.",
      "text": "Each suction lift fuel system and other fuel systems conducive to vapor formation must be free from vapor lock when using fuel at a temperature of 110 degrees F. under critical operating conditions. This must be shown by test.",
